RIFE 4.25 weights and the interpolation graph follow Practical-RIFE by hzwer,
which is also MIT: https://github.com/hzwer/Practical-RIFE
The checkpoint is downloaded at build time and is not vendored in this tree.
This project does not include Flowframes source or artwork.
